  "notes": "{巻|ま}く means to wind, wrap, or roll something around.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\nType: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- マフラーを{首|くび}に{巻|ま}く: to wrap a scarf around one's neck\n- {包帯|ほうたい}を{巻|ま}く: to wrap a bandage\n- {袖|そで}を{巻|ま}く: to roll up sleeves\n\nCOMPOUND VERBS:\n- {巻|ま}き{込|こ}む: to involve, drag into\n- {巻|ま}き{戻|もど}す: to rewind\n- {巻|ま}き{上|あ}げる: to roll up\n\nDON'T CONFUSE (all まく):\n- {巻|ま}く: to wind, wrap\n- {蒔|ま}く: to sow (seeds)\n- {撒|ま}く: to scatter",
